            "notes": "Powers can honestly be anything. Two-zu is something I buy a lot since I will need it. Leaf on the wind for if you just want more healing and more money. Self-Care if you are getting targeted and need a bit of self healing. You don't want to waste suzu on yourself if you can help it. \n\nItem wise Hardlight accelerator or Martian mender are my favorites. The first if you are ahead and the second if you are behind. Commander's clip is a worthy mention. Any of the \"increase fire rate\" items are good for M1/M2 goodies. Unless you are going hard into suzu in which case I probably would mess with Commander's clip.",
